    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hotlines dont change the fact that i'm alone. like, what is the point of staying in this loop? i tried to be a good person and it just destroyed my life. everything i worked for is gone and the world is just more corrupt than ever. it feels like i'm just an error in a broken system. there's no way to fix this, really.",
